@startuml
title SD04 - Customer not home during delivery (distribution)
autonumber

actor "Courier" as K
participant "Route" as R
participant "Customer" as C
participant "Delivery attempt" as D
participant "Order" as O

K -> R: showSchedule(date)
R --> K: schedule, addresses, contactDetails
K -> C: callCustomerWhenNoAnswer()
C --> K: customerAvailability
alt Customer available later the same day
  K -> R: adjustSchedule()
  R --> K: updatedSchedule
  K -> D: recordDelivery(timestamp)
  D -> O: updateOrderStatus(delivered)
  O --> D: statusUpdated
  D --> K: deliveryRecorded
else No one available on second attempt
  K -> D: recordRecipientAbsent()
  D -> O: updateOrderStatus(notDelivered)
  O --> D: statusUpdated
  D --> K: failedDeliveryRecorded
  K -> O: recordAdditionalDeliveryCosts(amount, explanation)
  O --> K: additionalCostsRecorded
  note right of K: Sales contacts the customer to arrange another delivery
end
@enduml
